    <p class="mb-10 leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Wildloop builds and serves its own map tiles. Our maps combine community map data with an open map schema and our own presentation. These credits also apply when Wildloop maps appear in partner apps and share images.</p>

    <div class="space-y-8 leading-relaxed text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
