        <p class="mt-2">A road or trail missing or incorrect? <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/fixthemap" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline dark:text-emerald-400">Improve this map through OpenStreetMap</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">OpenMapTiles</h2>
