      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Map software</h2>
        <p><a href="https://github.com/onthegomap/planetiler" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline dark:text-emerald-400">Planetiler</a> builds the tiles, <a href="https://github.com/protomaps/PMTiles" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline dark:text-emerald-400">PMTiles</a> stores the archive, and <a href="https://github.com/stacksjs/ts-maps" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline dark:text-emerald-400">ts-maps</a> renders interactive maps and static share maps.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Other map providers</h2>
        <p>Partner apps may use <a href="https://openfreemap.org/" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline dark:text-emerald-400">OpenFreeMap</a> or <a href="https://carto.com/attributions" class="text-emerald-600 hover:underline dark:text-emerald-400">CARTO</a> as a fallback. The credit on each map identifies the provider currently in use. OpenStreetMap data remains attributed when these sources are used.</p>
